[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さっきはロロナ先輩とステルクさん。今度は\n私たちの二人を残して出口は消えてしまった……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First it was Miss Rorona and Sterk. Now it's left two of us behind and the exit disappeared again..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもアタシたちが入ったときに、\n出口はまた開いたんすよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But when we came in, the exit opened again, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また二人を残して閉じちゃったけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Only to close again after leaving two people behind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人……二人か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Two people... two people..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「姫と騎士は村に取り残され、\n\u3000二人ぼっちになりましたとさ」",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "'The princess and knight were left behind in the village, alone together.'"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ステルクさん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その本の締めの部分だ。どうにも気になって\n頭に残っていた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's the ending of the book. Something about it bothered me and stuck in my mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "物語が進んで魔物が退治された今、\n村人は村から出ることができる。でも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that the story has progressed and the monsters have been defeated, the villagers can leave the village. But..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "物語の通り、二人が村に残らないと\nいけないということだとしたら……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If the story requires two people to remain in the village..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それがこの本の呪いの正体ってわけね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then that's the true nature of this book's curse."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずくないっすかね。\nこの中の誰か二人が残らないといけないとか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's not good. If two of us have to stay behind..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その必要はない！！\u3000安心するがいい！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's no need for that!! Fear not!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゴゥさん……！？\nどうしてここに……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou...?! Why are you here...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]